</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.260" end="00:59.740"><span begin="00:56.260" end="00:57.310">So </span><span begin="00:57.310" end="00:57.670">with </span><span begin="00:57.670" end="00:57.910">all </span><span begin="00:57.910" end="00:58.210">my </span><span begin="00:58.210" end="00:58.660">heart</span><span begin="00:58.660" end="00:58.660">, </span><span begin="00:58.660" end="00:58.900">I'm </span><span begin="00:58.900" end="00:59.350">gonna </span><span begin="00:59.350" end="00:59.740">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.740" end="01:02.200"><span begin="00:59.740" end="00:59.950">To </span><span begin="00:59.950" end="01:00.280">play </span><span begin="01:00.280" end="01:00.520">my </span><span begin="01:00.520" end="01:00.940">part</span><span begin="01:00.940" end="01:00.940">, </span><span begin="01:00.940" end="01:01.000">to </span><span begin="01:01.000" end="01:01.390">turn </span><span begin="01:01.390" end="01:01.690">on </span><span begin="01:01.690" end="01:01.750">the </span><span begin="01:01.750" end="01:02.200">lights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.200" end="01:08.140"><span begin="01:02.200" end="01:02.230">Wh</span><span begin="01:02.230" end="01:02.260">е</span><span begin="01:02.260" end="01:02.380">n </span><span begin="01:02.380" end="01:02.710">things </span><span begin="01:02.710" end="01:02.980">get </span><span begin="01:02.980" end="01:03.430">dark</span><span begin="01:03.430" end="01:03.460">, </span><span begin="01:03.460" end="01:03.760">I'm </span><span begin="01:03.760" end="01:04.150">gonna </span><span begin="01:04.150" end="01:04.540">give </span><span begin="01:04.540" end="01:04.690">you </span><span begin="01:04.690" end="01:06.220">everything </span><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:06.860">（</span><span begin="01:06.860" end="01:07.500">Oh</span><span begin="01:07.500" end="01:08.140">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.140" end="01:14.020"><span begin="01:08.140" end="01:08.290">With </sp